WEBVTT

00:01:55.486 --> 00:02:00.491
Because, you know, the ideas are based
off of electricity, you know?

00:02:00.491 --> 00:02:02.076
Ideas, like, come sharp.

00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:06.497
They sprint here, and they go here,
and they move there.

00:02:06.539 --> 00:02:07.707
They're nonlinear.

00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:11.627
I kind of feel like
they're like daydreams.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.463
You know? Intuition gets you there.

00:02:15.006 --> 00:02:19.051
It feels like something
that is just on the horizon.

00:02:19.844 --> 00:02:22.054
And then, sometimes,
it comes into sharp focus.

00:02:22.096 --> 00:02:24.557
You wake up and you remember
exactly what it was.

00:02:25.474 --> 00:02:28.019
That's what ideas feel like.

00:02:28.895 --> 00:02:32.106
And your intuition is actually
what helps you get there.